pecifies the number of a movement.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"movementTitle","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The movement-title element specifies the title of a movement, not including its number.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identification metadata for the score, such as creators, rights, source, and relation information."}]}],"name":"identification"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The score-wide defaults for scaling, layout, and default font and language values."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"defaults"},{"name":"credit","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The credits — such as title, composer, and copyright notices — that appear on the first or following pages of the score."}]}]},{"name":"partList","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The list of parts that make up the score, along with the part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets between them."}]}]},{"name":"measures","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The measures that make up the score, in the same order as they appear in the score."}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScoreTimewise\/init(version:work:movementNumber:movementTitle:identification:defaults:credit:partList:measures:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScoreTimewise"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLPartList","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLPartList"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLIdentification":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLIdentification"}],"title":"MXLIdentification","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlidentification","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLIdentification"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLIdentification","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Identification contains basic metadata about the score. It includes information that may apply at a score-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wide, movement-wide, or part-wide level. The creator, rights, source, and relation elements are based on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Dublin Core."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDefaults":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLDefaults","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The defaults type specifies score-wide defaults for scaling; whether or not the file is a concert score;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"layout; and default values for the music font, word font, lyric font, and lyric language. Except for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concert-score element, if any defaults are missing, the choice of what to use is determined by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"application.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLDefaults","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDefaults","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldefaults","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLDefaults","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLScoreTimewise/Measure":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<measure>"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"title":"MXLScoreTimewise.Measure","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Measure"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Measure"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlscoretimewise\/measure","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLScoreTimewise\/Measure"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDocument":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDocument"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A top-level document parsed from a MusicXML file."}],"title":"MXLDocument","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxldocument","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLDocument"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLDocument/Version":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument\/Version","title":"MXLDocument.Version","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Version","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"